// ZP-TBD-79 -- "Get Pre Need Info" Deal button.
// ZP-TBD-80 -- prepaid Pre-Need products at $0, unpaid balance as one line, liability release. (UPDATED 2026-09-28,
//              merged onto the LIVE function pulled 2026-09-28 -- replace the whole live body with this.)
// Carries everything from the person's Pre-Need plan onto the At-Need Deal and moves the
// Deal into the real funeral type.
//
// CRM > Setup > Customization > Modules and Fields > Deals > Links and Buttons > New Button
//   Button name  : Get Pre Need Info        Placement: Details page (top-right)
//   Action       : Writing Function (Deluge)  -> category "button", name getPreNeedInfo
//   Argument     : dealId = Deals - Deal Id
//   Connection   : zohooauth (Deals/Accounts/Contacts/Products/Invoices read, Deals write, Notes create,
//                  Pre_Need_Questionnaire read, System_Data read/write, COQL, Books retainer invoices read + comment)
//
// Requires: Deals field `Pre_Need_Deal_URL` (URL) -- ZP-TBD-79.
// Requires: ZP-TBD-78 already done on this Deal (Pre_Need_Status = "Matched").
// Requires (ZP-TBD-80): Product_Selection subform fields `Pre_Need_Line` (picklist Prepaid / Balance) and
//           `Pre_Need_Amount` (currency); product "Pre-Need Balance" (id in CONFIG below);
//           standalone.releasePreNeedLiability; patched createSalesOrdersForShipIns + manageZeroRatedProduct.
//
// DECISIONS
//   (developer, 2026-09-25)
//   * Existing values on the At-Need Deal are never overwritten -- BLANK FIELDS ONLY.
//   * Burial -> "Funeral w/Burial";  Cremation -> "Cremation with Service" (for now -- the
//     "Cremation Only" rule is pending Andrea).
//   * Hospital / Police / First Call Deals are converted IN PLACE (same Deal).
//   (Andrea via developer, 2026-09-28 -- ZP-TBD-80, replaces "products keep the contract price")
//   * Pre-Need products land on the At-Need Deal as PREPAID lines at $0 -- the family is not invoiced again.
//   * Plan not fully paid -> ONE "Pre-Need Balance" line for (contract value - paid) is billed at-need, and the
//     Pre-Need installment reminders stop.
//   * Only prepaid lines on the Deal -> NO Sales Order / Invoice at all (the SO function skips it). Anything the
//     family adds later is billed by the normal SO/Invoice process, with the prepaid lines at $0 next to it.
//   * The Pre-Need money sitting in Xero "PRE NEED" liability (26100) is released to revenue automatically
//     (standalone.releasePreNeedLiability -> Xero manual journal), once per Pre-Need.
//   * No product swaps expected (per developer) -- a prepaid line is not credited against a replacement.
//
// WHAT IT DOES
//   0. Guards: Deal Type is First Call / Hospital / Police (or already a funeral type, for a
//      re-run); Pre_Need_Status = Matched; Deal has an Account.
//   1. Finds the Pre-Need Deal (Type = "Pre Need", same Account; or the one already stored in
//      Pre_Need_Deal_URL) and its Pre_Need_Questionnaire record.
//      1b. Reads what was PAID from the Pre-Need's Books retainer invoice(s) (payment_made), falling back to
//          the Deal's Amount_Paid_To_Date.
//   2. Fills BLANK At-Need Deal fields from the Pre-Need Deal first, then from the questionnaire.
//   3. Adds the Pre-Need products to Product_Selection as Pre_Need_Line = "Prepaid", Discount = full catalogue
//      price (so $0), Pre_Need_Amount = the contract value of that line (for reference). Skips a product already
//      on the Deal. If the plan is not fully paid, adds one "Pre-Need Balance" row (Pre_Need_Line = "Balance",
//      Pre_Need_Amount = contract value - paid).
//   4. Copies the Pre-Need Deal's Contact Roles and the main Contact if the At-Need Deal has none.
//   5. Sets Type (with workflows ON) -> `updateDealPipelineOnTypeUpdate` moves Pipeline / Layout / Stage.
//   6. Only if a Balance line was added: stamps Trigger_Based_On_Subform = now + 2 min -> the normal
//      "Create or Update Sales Order from Deals V2" rule builds the SO / Invoice for the balance.
//      6b. Marks the Pre-Need as converted (System_Data "Pre_Need_Converted") -> installment reminders stop.
//      6c. Releases the paid amount from Xero 26100 to revenue (idempotent; retried on every click until done).
//   7. Notes on the Deal + back-link Note on the Pre-Need Deal + a comment on the Books retainer (first run only).
//
// Safe to click again: blank-only fields, products de-duplicated by product id, one Balance line max,
// Contact Roles de-duplicated, Type only changed from First Call / Hospital / Police, liability released once,
// Notes only on the first run (Pre_Need_Deal_URL empty before this run).
//
// Returns a plain-text summary for the button popup.
string button.getPreNeedInfo(String dealId)
{
// ---- CONFIG (ZP-TBD-80) ----
// CRM id of the product "Pre-Need Balance" (non-taxable, NOT Zero Rated). "" = the balance line is not added
// automatically (a warning tells staff to add it by hand).
balanceProductId = "6503357000084242156";
// Parent product the "Pre-Need Balance" product sits under (the Child_Product lookup filter is re-validated on
// save). "" = no parent written.
balanceParentProductId = "6503357000020022230";
booksOrgId = "872327358";
// ----------------------------
nl = zoho.encryption.urlDecode("%0A");
orgUrl = "https://crm.zoho.com/crm/org871210233/tab/Deals/";
dId = ifnull(dealId,"").toString().trim();
if(dId == "")
{
	return "Missing Deal id.";
}
warnings = List();
try
{
	// ================= 0. read the At-Need Deal + guards =================
	deal = Map();
	dealResp = invokeurl
	[
		url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Deals/" + dId
		type :GET
		connection:"zohooauth"
	];
	try
	{
		deal = dealResp.get("data").get(0);
	}
	catch (eDeal)
	{
		deal = Map();
	}
	if(!deal.containKey("id"))
	{
		return "Could not read this Deal.";
	}
	dType = ifnull(deal.get("Type"),"").toString();
	intakeTypes = {"First Call","Hospital","Police"};
	funeralTypes = {"Funeral w/Burial","Cremation with Service","Cremation Only"};
	if(!intakeTypes.contains(dType) && !funeralTypes.contains(dType))
	{
		return "Get Pre Need Info only works on First Call, Hospital or Police Deals (this Deal is '" + dType + "').";
	}
	if(ifnull(deal.get("Pre_Need_Status"),"").toString() != "Matched")
	{
		return "This Deal is not linked to a Pre-Need yet. Use 'Link Pre-Need' first (Pre-Need Status must be 'Matched').";
	}
	acctId = "";
	try
	{
		acctId = ifnull(deal.get("Account_Name").get("id"),"").toString();
	}
	catch (eAcct)
	{
		acctId = "";
	}
	if(acctId == "")
	{
		return "This Deal has no Account, so its Pre-Need cannot be found.";
	}
	// ================= 1. find the Pre-Need Deal =================
	pnDealId = "";
	firstRun = true;
	try
	{
		// URL field (not a lookup -- Deals is at its lookup-field limit); the Deal id is the
		// last part of the link, e.g. .../tab/Deals/6503357000083513326
		pnUrl = ifnull(deal.get("Pre_Need_Deal_URL"),"").toString().trim();
		if(pnUrl.contains("/Deals/"))
		{
			pnDealId = pnUrl.getSuffix("/Deals/").trim();
			if(pnDealId.contains("?"))
			{
				pnDealId = pnDealId.getPrefix("?");
			}
		}
	}
	catch (ePnLk)
	{
		pnDealId = "";
	}
	if(pnDealId != "")
	{
		firstRun = false;
	}
	else
	{
		pnQ = Map();
		pnQ.put("select_query","select id, Stage, Created_Time from Deals where Type = 'Pre Need' and Account_Name = '" + acctId + "' order by Created_Time desc limit 10");
		pnResp = invokeurl
		[
			url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v7/coql"
			type :POST
			parameters:pnQ.toString()
			connection:"zohooauth"
		];
		// COQL answers "no rows" with an EMPTY reply, not a Map -- read defensively.
		pnRows = List();
		try
		{
			pnRows = pnResp.get("data");
		}
		catch (ePnRows)
		{
			pnRows = List();
		}
		if(pnRows == null)
		{
			pnRows = List();
		}
		liveCount = 0;
		for each  pnRow in pnRows
		{
			pnStage = ifnull(pnRow.get("Stage"),"").toString();
			if(!pnStage.startsWith("Closed Lost"))
			{
				if(pnDealId == "")
				{
					pnDealId = ifnull(pnRow.get("id"),"").toString();
				}
				liveCount = liveCount + 1;
			}
		}
		if(pnDealId == "" && pnRows.size() > 0)
		{
			// only Closed Lost plans exist -- still use the newest, but say so
			pnDealId = ifnull(pnRows.get(0).get("id"),"").toString();
			warnings.add("The only Pre-Need Deal on this Account is Closed Lost -- check it is the right plan.");
		}
		if(liveCount > 1)
		{
			warnings.add("This Account has " + liveCount + " open Pre-Need Deals. The newest one was used: " + orgUrl + pnDealId);
		}
	}
	if(pnDealId == "")
	{
		return "No Pre-Need Deal was found on this Deal's Account.";
	}
	pn = Map();
	pnDealResp = invokeurl
	[
		url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Deals/" + pnDealId
		type :GET
		connection:"zohooauth"
	];
	try
	{
		pn = pnDealResp.get("data").get(0);
	}
	catch (ePnDeal)
	{
		pn = Map();
	}
	if(!pn.containKey("id"))
	{
		return "Could not read the Pre-Need Deal " + pnDealId + ".";
	}
	// ---- the questionnaire (CRM module, lookup Deal_Name -> Pre-Need Deal) ----
	qn = Map();
	qQ = Map();
	qQ.put("select_query","select id from Pre_Need_Questionnaire where Deal_Name = '" + pnDealId + "' order by Modified_Time desc limit 1");
	qResp = invokeurl
	[
		url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v7/coql"
		type :POST
		parameters:qQ.toString()
		connection:"zohooauth"
	];
	qRows = List();
	try
	{
		qRows = qResp.get("data");
	}
	catch (eQRows)
	{
		qRows = List();
	}
	if(qRows != null && qRows.size() > 0)
	{
		qnId = ifnull(qRows.get(0).get("id"),"").toString();
		qnResp = invokeurl
		[
			url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Pre_Need_Questionnaire/" + qnId
			type :GET
			connection:"zohooauth"
		];
		try
		{
			qn = qnResp.get("data").get(0);
		}
		catch (eQn)
		{
			qn = Map();
		}
	}
	if(qn.isEmpty())
	{
		warnings.add("No Pre-Need Questionnaire was found -- only the Pre-Need Deal's own data was used.");
	}
	// ================= 1b. what was PAID on the Pre-Need (ZP-TBD-80) =================
	// Books master retainer = source of truth (ZP-TBD-74/76). The Pre-Need's CRM invoices (deposit / installments)
	// carry its Books id; several CRM invoices can point at the same retainer, so ids are de-duplicated.
	pnPaid = 0;
	try
	{
		pnPaid = ifnull(pn.get("Amount_Paid_To_Date"),0).toString().toDecimal();
	}
	catch (ePaid)
	{
		pnPaid = 0;
	}
	retainerIds = List();
	paidAmount = 0;
	paidBase = 0;
	paidFromBooks = false;
	try
	{
		rQ = Map();
		rQ.put("select_query","select Books_Invoice_ID from Invoices where Deal_Name__s = '" + pnDealId + "' and Retainer_Invoice = true limit 50");
		rResp = invokeurl
		[
			url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v7/coql"
			type :POST
			parameters:rQ.toString()
			connection:"zohooauth"
		];
		rRows = List();
		try
		{
			rRows = rResp.get("data");
		}
		catch (eRRows)
		{
			rRows = List();
		}
		if(rRows == null)
		{
			rRows = List();
		}
		for each  rRow in rRows
		{
			bId = ifnull(rRow.get("Books_Invoice_ID"),"").toString().trim();
			if(bId != "" && !retainerIds.contains(bId))
			{
				retainerIds.add(bId);
			}
		}
		for each  bId in retainerIds
		{
			riResp = zoho.books.getRecordsByID("retainerinvoices",booksOrgId,bId,"zohooauth");
			ri = riResp.get("retainerinvoice");
			pm = ifnull(ri.get("payment_made"),0).toString().toDecimal();
			xr = ifnull(ri.get("exchange_rate"),1).toString().toDecimal();
			if(xr <= 0)
			{
				xr = 1;
			}
			paidAmount = paidAmount + pm;
			// Xero books in JMD -> the liability release needs the base-currency value
			paidBase = paidBase + pm * xr;
			paidFromBooks = true;
		}
	}
	catch (eRetainer)
	{
		paidFromBooks = false;
		info "getPreNeedInfo: Books retainer read failed: " + eRetainer;
	}
	if(!paidFromBooks)
	{
		paidAmount = pnPaid;
		paidBase = pnPaid;
		warnings.add("The Pre-Need's Books retainer could not be read -- the paid amount (" + pnPaid + ") was taken from the Pre-Need Deal's 'Amount Paid To Date'.");
	}
	paidAmount = paidAmount.round(2);
	paidBase = paidBase.round(2);
	// ================= 2. blank-only field fill =================
	fill = Map();
	// 2a. from the Pre-Need Deal (same field on both Deals)
	sameFields = {"Service_Type","Service_Format_Type","Casket_or_Urn","Casket_Type","Primary_Color","Secondary_Color","Handles","Special_Instructions1","Plot","Plot_No","Grave_Type","Church_Chapel","Place_of_Internment","Obituary","Obituary_Info","Flowers","Programmes","Headstone_Epitaph1","Headstone_Shape","Date_of_Birth","Place_of_Birth","City_of_Birth","Country_of_Birth","Sex","Marital_Status","Occupation","Parish","Case_Location","Currency_Used_for_this_Deal","Pre_Need_Specialist"};
	for each  sf in sameFields
	{
		srcVal = ifnull(pn.get(sf),"").toString().trim();
		dstVal = ifnull(deal.get(sf),"").toString().trim();
		if(srcVal != "" && dstVal == "")
		{
			fill.put(sf,pn.get(sf));
		}
	}
	if(pn.get("Hillview") == true && deal.get("Hillview") != true)
	{
		fill.put("Hillview",true);
	}
	// payments already made (snapshot -- the live value stays on the Pre-Need Deal)
	atPaid = 0;
	try
	{
		atPaid = ifnull(deal.get("Amount_Paid_To_Date"),0).toString().toDecimal();
	}
	catch (eAtPaid)
	{
		atPaid = 0;
	}
	if(paidAmount > 0 && atPaid == 0)
	{
		fill.put("Amount_Paid_To_Date",paidAmount);
	}
	// 2b. from the questionnaire (only where 2a left the field blank)
	disposition = "";
	if(!qn.isEmpty())
	{
		disposition = ifnull(qn.get("Disposition_Preference"),"").toString().trim();
		if(disposition == "-None-")
		{
			disposition = "";
		}
		qMap = Map();
		qMap.put("Church_Chapel","Place_of_Worship");
		qMap.put("Obituary_Info","Obituary_Information");
		qMap.put("Flowers","Flowers");
		qMap.put("Programmes","Programme_Style");
		qMap.put("Headstone_Epitaph1","Inscription");
		for each  dealField in qMap.keys()
		{
			qVal = ifnull(qn.get(qMap.get(dealField)),"").toString().trim();
			dstVal = ifnull(deal.get(dealField),"").toString().trim();
			if(qVal != "" && dstVal == "" && !fill.containKey(dealField))
			{
				fill.put(dealField,qVal);
			}
		}
		// Place of internment = Cemetery + burial location lines
		placeParts = List();
		placeKeys = {"Cemetery","Burial_Location_Line_1","Burial_Location_Line_2","Burial_Location_City","Burial_Location_State","Burial_Location_Postal_Code"};
		for each  pk in placeKeys
		{
			pv = ifnull(qn.get(pk),"").toString().trim();
			if(pv != "")
			{
				placeParts.add(pv);
			}
		}
		if(placeParts.size() > 0 && ifnull(deal.get("Place_of_Internment"),"").toString().trim() == "" && !fill.containKey("Place_of_Internment"))
		{
			fill.put("Place_of_Internment",placeParts.toString(", "));
		}
		// Service Type / Casket or Urn from the disposition
		if(disposition != "" && ifnull(deal.get("Service_Type"),"").toString().trim() == "" && !fill.containKey("Service_Type"))
		{
			if(disposition == "Burial")
			{
				fill.put("Service_Type","Funeral with Burial");
			}
			else if(disposition == "Cremation")
			{
				fill.put("Service_Type","Cremation");
			}
		}
		if(ifnull(deal.get("Casket_or_Urn"),"").toString().trim() == "" && !fill.containKey("Casket_or_Urn"))
		{
			intermentText = ifnull(qn.get("Interment_Type"),"").toString();
			if(disposition == "Burial")
			{
				fill.put("Casket_or_Urn","Casket");
			}
			else if(disposition == "Cremation" && intermentText.contains("Urn"))
			{
				fill.put("Casket_or_Urn","Urn");
			}
		}
	}
	// 2c. the wishes block (answers with no matching Deal field)
	wishLines = List();
	pnFsi = ifnull(pn.get("Funeral_Special_Instructions"),"").toString().trim();
	if(pnFsi != "")
	{
		wishLines.add(pnFsi);
	}
	if(!qn.isEmpty())
	{
		wishLabels = Map();
		wishLabels.put("Ceremony_Preferences","Ceremony preferences");
		wishLabels.put("Imagined_Service","Imagined service");
		wishLabels.put("Songs","Songs");
		wishLabels.put("Readings","Readings");
		wishLabels.put("Prayers","Prayers");
		wishLabels.put("Clothing_and_Accessories","Clothing and accessories");
		wishLabels.put("Ashes_Instructions","Ashes instructions");
		wishLabels.put("Interment_Description","Interment description");
		wishLabels.put("Headstone_Type","Headstone type");
		wishLabels.put("Additional_Instructions","Additional instructions");
		for each  wk in wishLabels.keys()
		{
			wv = ifnull(qn.get(wk),"").toString().trim();
			if(wv != "")
			{
				wishLines.add(wishLabels.get(wk) + ": " + wv);
			}
		}
		// Interment Type is a multi-select -> comes back as a List
		itText = "";
		try
		{
			itList = qn.get("Interment_Type");
			if(itList != null && itList.size() > 0)
			{
				itText = itList.toString(", ");
			}
		}
		catch (eIt)
		{
			itText = ifnull(qn.get("Interment_Type"),"").toString().trim();
		}
		if(itText != "")
		{
			wishLines.add("Interment type: " + itText);
		}
		persons = List();
		try
		{
			persons = ifnull(qn.get("Persons_Responsible"),List());
		}
		catch (ePersons)
		{
			persons = List();
		}
		personText = List();
		for each  prs in persons
		{
			prName = ifnull(prs.get("Name1"),"").toString().trim();
			if(prName != "")
			{
				prLine = prName;
				prRel = ifnull(prs.get("Relationship"),"").toString().trim();
				prPhone = ifnull(prs.get("Phone"),"").toString().trim();
				if(prRel != "")
				{
					prLine = prLine + " (" + prRel + ")";
				}
				if(prPhone != "")
				{
					prLine = prLine + " " + prPhone;
				}
				personText.add(prLine);
			}
		}
		if(personText.size() > 0)
		{
			wishLines.add("Persons responsible: " + personText.toString("; "));
		}
	}
	wishBlock = "";
	if(wishLines.size() > 0)
	{
		wishBlock = "PRE-NEED WISHES" + nl + wishLines.toString(nl);
		if(ifnull(deal.get("Funeral_Special_Instructions"),"").toString().trim() == "")
		{
			fill.put("Funeral_Special_Instructions",wishBlock);
		}
	}
	// main Contact
	atContactId = "";
	try
	{
		atContactId = ifnull(deal.get("Contact_Name").get("id"),"").toString();
	}
	catch (eAtCon)
	{
		atContactId = "";
	}
	if(atContactId == "")
	{
		try
		{
			pnContactId = ifnull(pn.get("Contact_Name").get("id"),"").toString();
			if(pnContactId != "")
			{
				conLk = Map();
				conLk.put("id",pnContactId);
				fill.put("Contact_Name",conLk);
			}
		}
		catch (ePnCon)
		{
		}
	}
	fieldsFilled = fill.size();
	// ================= 3. products: PREPAID at $0 + one Balance line (ZP-TBD-80) =================
	// Product_Selection.Unit_Price is a READ-ONLY field copied from the product, so it is never written here.
	// The SO function prices every line from the catalogue; for "Prepaid" lines it now sets
	// Discount = catalogue x quantity (always $0 whatever today's price is), and for the "Balance" line it uses
	// Pre_Need_Amount as the price. Discount is also written here so the Deal itself shows the line at $0.
	existingRows = ifnull(deal.get("Product_Selection"),List());
	existingProductIds = List();
	keepRows = List();
	balanceAlreadyOnDeal = false;
	for each  er in existingRows
	{
		keepRow = Map();
		keepRow.put("id",er.get("id"));
		keepRows.add(keepRow);
		try
		{
			existingProductIds.add(ifnull(er.get("Child_Product").get("id"),"").toString());
		}
		catch (eEr)
		{
		}
		if(ifnull(er.get("Pre_Need_Line"),"").toString() == "Balance")
		{
			balanceAlreadyOnDeal = true;
		}
	}
	newRows = List();
	productsAdded = 0;
	productsSkipped = 0;
	contractSum = 0;
	for each  pr in ifnull(pn.get("Product_Selection"),List())
	{
		childId = "";
		try
		{
			childId = ifnull(pr.get("Child_Product").get("id"),"").toString();
		}
		catch (eChild)
		{
			childId = "";
		}
		if(childId == "")
		{
			continue;
		}
		qty = ifnull(pr.get("Quantity"),1).toString().toDecimal();
		contractUnit = ifnull(pr.get("Unit_Price"),0).toString().toDecimal();
		contractDisc = ifnull(pr.get("Discount"),0).toString().toDecimal();
		contractTotal = (contractUnit * qty - contractDisc).round(2);
		contractSum = contractSum + contractTotal;
		if(existingProductIds.contains(childId))
		{
			productsSkipped = productsSkipped + 1;
			continue;
		}
		catalogUnit = contractUnit;
		try
		{
			prod = zoho.crm.getRecordById("Products",childId.toLong());
			catalogUnit = ifnull(prod.get("Unit_Price"),contractUnit).toString().toDecimal();
		}
		catch (eProd)
		{
			catalogUnit = contractUnit;
		}
		nr = Map();
		childLk = Map();
		childLk.put("id",childId);
		nr.put("Child_Product",childLk);
		try
		{
			parentId = ifnull(pr.get("Parent_Product").get("id"),"").toString();
			if(parentId != "")
			{
				parentLk = Map();
				parentLk.put("id",parentId);
				nr.put("Parent_Product",parentLk);
			}
		}
		catch (eParent)
		{
		}
		if(ifnull(pr.get("Child_Category"),"").toString() != "")
		{
			nr.put("Child_Category",pr.get("Child_Category"));
		}
		if(ifnull(pr.get("Casket_Trim_Color"),"").toString() != "")
		{
			nr.put("Casket_Trim_Color",pr.get("Casket_Trim_Color"));
		}
		// Quantity is an integer field
		nr.put("Quantity",qty.toLong());
		nr.put("Discount",(catalogUnit * qty).round(2));
		nr.put("Pre_Need_Line","Prepaid");
		nr.put("Pre_Need_Amount",contractTotal);
		newRows.add(nr);
		productsAdded = productsAdded + 1;
	}
	// ---- the unpaid part of the Pre-Need contract ----
	contractValue = 0;
	try
	{
		contractValue = ifnull(pn.get("Contract_Value"),0).toString().toDecimal();
	}
	catch (eCv)
	{
		contractValue = 0;
	}
	if(contractValue <= 0)
	{
		contractValue = contractSum;
		warnings.add("The Pre-Need Deal has no Contract Value -- the sum of its product lines (" + contractSum.round(2) + ") was used.");
	}
	balanceDue = (contractValue - paidAmount).round(2);
	balanceAdded = false;
	if(balanceDue > 0 && !balanceAlreadyOnDeal)
	{
		if(balanceProductId == "")
		{
			warnings.add("The Pre-Need is not fully paid: " + balanceDue + " is still owed, but the 'Pre-Need Balance' product is not set up in the button yet. Add the balance to this Deal by hand.");
		}
		else
		{
			br = Map();
			balLk = Map();
			balLk.put("id",balanceProductId);
			br.put("Child_Product",balLk);
			if(balanceParentProductId != "")
			{
				balParentLk = Map();
				balParentLk.put("id",balanceParentProductId);
				br.put("Parent_Product",balParentLk);
			}
			br.put("Quantity",1);
			br.put("Discount",0);
			br.put("Pre_Need_Line","Balance");
			br.put("Pre_Need_Amount",balanceDue);
			newRows.add(br);
			balanceAdded = true;
		}
	}
	if(balanceDue < 0)
	{
		warnings.add("More was paid on the Pre-Need (" + paidAmount + ") than its contract value (" + contractValue + ") -- check whether a refund or credit is due.");
	}
	if(newRows.size() > 0)
	{
		// Existing rows MUST be sent back (id only) -- a subform write drops any row it omits.
		allRows = List();
		allRows.addAll(keepRows);
		allRows.addAll(newRows);
		fill.put("Product_Selection",allRows);
	}
	// link back to the Pre-Need Deal
	fill.put("Pre_Need_Deal_URL",orgUrl + pnDealId);
	// ---- write 1: data only, NO workflows (Type change + SO come after) ----
	upd1List = List();
	upd1List.add(fill);
	upd1Body = Map();
	upd1Body.put("data",upd1List);
	upd1Resp = invokeurl
	[
		url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Deals/" + dId
		type :PUT
		parameters:upd1Body.toString()
		connection:"zohooauth"
	];
	// invokeurl does not throw on an API rejection -- read the code
	upd1Code = "";
	try
	{
		upd1Code = ifnull(upd1Resp.get("data").get(0).get("code"),"").toString();
	}
	catch (eUpd1)
	{
		upd1Code = "";
	}
	if(upd1Code != "SUCCESS")
	{
		return "Could not save the Pre-Need info on this Deal. Zoho said: " + upd1Resp.toString();
	}
	// ================= 4. Contact Roles =================
	// FIX 2026-09-29: setting Contact_Name (step 2, or at intake) makes Zoho put that contact on the Deal's
	// Contact Roles automatically WITH NO ROLE. The first version skipped any contact already on the Deal, so
	// the role stayed blank. Now: a contact that is missing OR on the Deal with a blank role gets the Pre-Need
	// Deal's role; a contact that already has a role is never changed (blank-only rule).
	rolesAdded = 0;
	atRoleIds = List();
	try
	{
		atRolesResp = invokeurl
		[
			url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Deals/" + dId + "/Contact_Roles?fields=Email,Contact_Role"
			type :GET
			connection:"zohooauth"
		];
		for each  ar in atRolesResp.get("data")
		{
			// only contacts that already HAVE a role count as done (a blank role reads back as {"id":null})
			arRoleId = "";
			try
			{
				arRoleId = ifnull(ar.get("Contact_Role").get("id"),"").toString();
			}
			catch (eArRole)
			{
				arRoleId = "";
			}
			if(arRoleId != "" && arRoleId != "null")
			{
				atRoleIds.add(ifnull(ar.get("id"),"").toString());
			}
		}
	}
	catch (eAtRoles)
	{
		// no roles yet -> empty reply
	}
	try
	{
		pnRolesResp = invokeurl
		[
			url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Deals/" + pnDealId + "/Contact_Roles?fields=Email,Contact_Role"
			type :GET
			connection:"zohooauth"
		];
		for each  prl in pnRolesResp.get("data")
		{
			cId = ifnull(prl.get("id"),"").toString();
			pnRoleId = "";
			try
			{
				pnRoleId = ifnull(prl.get("Contact_Role").get("id"),"").toString();
			}
			catch (ePnRole)
			{
				pnRoleId = "";
			}
			if(pnRoleId == "null")
			{
				pnRoleId = "";
			}
			if(cId != "" && pnRoleId != "" && !atRoleIds.contains(cId))
			{
				roleLk = Map();
				roleLk.put("id",pnRoleId);
				roleRow = Map();
				roleRow.put("Contact_Role",roleLk);
				roleList = List();
				roleList.add(roleRow);
				roleBody = Map();
				roleBody.put("data",roleList);
				roleResp = invokeurl
				[
					url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Deals/" + dId + "/Contact_Roles/" + cId
					type :PUT
					parameters:roleBody.toString()
					connection:"zohooauth"
				];
				try
				{
					if(ifnull(roleResp.get("data").get(0).get("code"),"").toString() == "SUCCESS")
					{
						rolesAdded = rolesAdded + 1;
					}
				}
				catch (eRoleResp)
				{
					info "getPreNeedInfo: contact role add failed: " + roleResp;
				}
			}
		}
	}
	catch (ePnRoles)
	{
		// Pre-Need Deal has no Contact Roles -> empty reply
	}
	// ================= 5. Deal Type (workflows ON) =================
	typeMsg = "";
	newType = "";
	if(disposition == "")
	{
		pnService = ifnull(pn.get("Service_Type"),"").toString();
		if(pnService == "Funeral with Burial")
		{
			disposition = "Burial";
		}
		else if(pnService == "Cremation")
		{
			disposition = "Cremation";
		}
	}
	if(disposition == "Burial")
	{
		newType = "Funeral w/Burial";
	}
	else if(disposition == "Cremation")
	{
		// "Cremation Only" rule pending Andrea -- every cremation plan is "with Service" for now
		newType = "Cremation with Service";
	}
	if(intakeTypes.contains(dType))
	{
		if(newType == "")
		{
			typeMsg = "Type NOT changed: the Pre-Need does not say Burial or Cremation. Set the Type by hand.";
			warnings.add(typeMsg);
		}
		else
		{
			typeUpd = Map();
			typeUpd.put("Type",newType);
			typeResp = zoho.crm.updateRecord("Deals",dId.toLong(),typeUpd,{"trigger":{"workflow"}});
			if(ifnull(typeResp.get("id"),"").toString() != "")
			{
				typeMsg = "Type changed: " + dType + " -> " + newType + " (pipeline moves automatically).";
			}
			else
			{
				typeMsg = "Type could NOT be changed to " + newType + ": " + typeResp.toString();
				warnings.add(typeMsg);
			}
		}
	}
	else
	{
		typeMsg = "Type left as '" + dType + "' (already a funeral Deal).";
		if(newType != "" && newType != dType)
		{
			warnings.add("The Pre-Need plan points to '" + newType + "' but this Deal is '" + dType + "'. Check which is right.");
		}
	}
	// ================= 6. Sales Order -- only when there is something to bill =================
	// Prepaid lines alone are NOT billed (ZP-TBD-80): no stamp, and the SO function skips a Deal that holds only
	// prepaid lines. The balance line is billed through the normal product trigger.
	if(balanceAdded)
	{
		// Same stamp the Product Selection client scripts use; +2 min so the pipeline
		// move from step 5 has finished before "Create or Update Sales Order from Deals V2" runs.
		standalone.getCurrentDateTime("Trigger_Based_On_Subform",dId.toLong(),"Deals",2);
	}
	// ---- 6b. mark the Pre-Need as converted -> installment reminders stop (sendInstallmentReminder checks this) ----
	try
	{
		convRows = standalone.COQLQuery("select id from System_Data where Module_Name = 'Deals' and Module_ID = '" + pnDealId + "' and Name = 'Pre_Need_Converted' limit 1");
		if(convRows.size() == 0)
		{
			convMap = Map();
			convMap.put("Name","Pre_Need_Converted");
			convMap.put("Module_Name","Deals");
			convMap.put("Module_ID",pnDealId);
			convMap.put("System_Info","At-Need Deal " + dId + " on " + zoho.currentdate.toString("yyyy-MM-dd"));
			convResp = zoho.crm.createRecord("System_Data",convMap);
			// createRecord does not throw on a rejection -- check for the new id
			if(ifnull(convResp.get("id"),"").toString() == "")
			{
				warnings.add("Could not mark the Pre-Need as converted -- its installment reminders may still go out: " + convResp.toString());
			}
		}
	}
	catch (eConv)
	{
		warnings.add("Could not mark the Pre-Need as converted -- its installment reminders may still go out: " + eConv.toString());
	}
	// ---- 6c. release the paid amount from Xero "PRE NEED" liability (26100) to revenue -- once per Pre-Need ----
	releaseMsg = "Liability release: nothing paid, nothing to release.";
	if(paidBase > 0)
	{
		releaseResult = standalone.releasePreNeedLiability(pnDealId,dId,paidBase.toString());
		if(releaseResult.startsWith("released"))
		{
			releaseMsg = "Liability release: " + paidBase + " moved from Pre-Need liability to revenue in Xero (" + releaseResult + ").";
		}
		else if(releaseResult.startsWith("already"))
		{
			releaseMsg = "Liability release: already done earlier (" + releaseResult + ").";
		}
		else
		{
			releaseMsg = "Liability release NOT done: " + releaseResult + ". Click Get Pre Need Info again later to retry.";
			warnings.add(releaseMsg);
		}
	}
	// ================= 7. Notes (first run only) =================
	if(firstRun)
	{
		noteLines = List();
		noteLines.add("Pre-Need info pulled from " + orgUrl + pnDealId + " on " + zoho.currentdate.toString("yyyy-MM-dd") + ".");
		noteLines.add("Fields filled (blank fields only): " + fieldsFilled);
		noteLines.add("Products added as PREPAID (billed at $0): " + productsAdded + " (already on the Deal: " + productsSkipped + ")");
		noteLines.add("Contact Roles added: " + rolesAdded);
		noteLines.add(typeMsg);
		noteLines.add("");
		noteLines.add("PAYMENTS ALREADY MADE");
		noteLines.add("Contract value: " + contractValue);
		noteLines.add("Deposit: " + ifnull(pn.get("Pre_Need_Deposit_Amount"),"-"));
		noteLines.add("Amount paid to date: " + paidAmount);
		noteLines.add("Payment type: " + ifnull(pn.get("Payment_Type"),"-"));
		if(balanceAdded)
		{
			noteLines.add("Unpaid balance " + balanceDue + " added as one 'Pre-Need Balance' line -- billed on this Deal's invoice. Pre-Need installment reminders are stopped.");
		}
		else if(balanceDue > 0)
		{
			noteLines.add("Unpaid balance " + balanceDue + " was NOT added automatically -- see CHECK below.");
		}
		else
		{
			noteLines.add("The Pre-Need is fully paid -- nothing more is billed for it.");
		}
		noteLines.add("Do NOT apply the Pre-Need retainer to any invoice on this Deal: the prepaid products are already $0.");
		noteLines.add(releaseMsg);
		if(wishBlock != "")
		{
			noteLines.add("");
			noteLines.add(wishBlock);
		}
		if(warnings.size() > 0)
		{
			noteLines.add("");
			noteLines.add("CHECK: " + warnings.toString(nl + "CHECK: "));
		}
		noteMap = Map();
		noteMap.put("Note_Title","Pre-Need info pulled");
		noteMap.put("Note_Content",noteLines.toString(nl));
		noteParent = Map();
		noteParentModule = Map();
		noteParentModule.put("api_name","Deals");
		noteParent.put("module",noteParentModule);
		noteParent.put("id",dId);
		noteMap.put("Parent_Id",noteParent);
		noteList = List();
		noteList.add(noteMap);
		noteBody = Map();
		noteBody.put("data",noteList);
		try
		{
			invokeurl
			[
				url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Notes"
				type :POST
				parameters:noteBody.toString()
				connection:"zohooauth"
			]
		}
		catch (eNote)
		{
			info "getPreNeedInfo: note failed: " + eNote;
		}
		// back-link on the Pre-Need Deal (a lookup would have given a related list; the URL
		// field does not, so a Note records where the plan was used)
		backNote = Map();
		backNote.put("Note_Title","Used for At-Need Deal");
		backNote.put("Note_Content","This Pre-Need plan was pulled into At-Need Deal '" + ifnull(deal.get("Deal_Name"),"") + "' ( " + orgUrl + dId + " ) on " + zoho.currentdate.toString("yyyy-MM-dd") + ". Its products are on that Deal as prepaid ($0) lines; installment reminders are stopped.");
		backParent = Map();
		backParent.put("module",noteParentModule);
		backParent.put("id",pnDealId);
		backNote.put("Parent_Id",backParent);
		backList = List();
		backList.add(backNote);
		backBody = Map();
		backBody.put("data",backList);
		try
		{
			invokeurl
			[
				url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/crm/v8/Notes"
				type :POST
				parameters:backBody.toString()
				connection:"zohooauth"
			]
		}
		catch (eBackNote)
		{
			info "getPreNeedInfo: back-link note failed: " + eBackNote;
		}
		// ZP-TBD-80: a comment on the Books retainer so nobody applies it to the at-need invoice by hand. A comment
		// (not a custom-field edit) on purpose: it does not fire the retainer's own update workflows.
		for each  bId in retainerIds
		{
			try
			{
				cmt = Map();
				cmt.put("description","USED FOR AT-NEED DEAL " + orgUrl + dId + " on " + zoho.currentdate.toString("yyyy-MM-dd") + ". The prepaid products are $0 on that Deal -- do NOT apply this retainer to any invoice. Paid amount released from PRE NEED liability by Xero manual journal (see the Deal's notes).");
				invokeurl
				[
					url :"https://www.zohoapis.com/books/v3/retainerinvoices/" + bId + "/comments?organization_id=" + booksOrgId
					type :POST
					parameters:cmt.toString()
					headers:{"Content-Type":"application/json"}
					connection:"zohooauth"
				]
			}
			catch (eCmt)
			{
				info "getPreNeedInfo: retainer comment failed for " + bId + ": " + eCmt;
			}
		}
	}
	// ================= summary for the popup =================
	summary = List();
	summary.add("Pre-Need info pulled.");
	summary.add("Fields filled: " + fieldsFilled + " (blank fields only)");
	summary.add("Products added as PREPAID ($0): " + productsAdded + " (already on the Deal: " + productsSkipped + ")");
	summary.add("Contact Roles added: " + rolesAdded);
	summary.add(typeMsg);
	if(balanceAdded)
	{
		summary.add("Unpaid Pre-Need balance added: " + balanceDue + ". The Sales Order / Invoice for it will be built in about 2 minutes.");
	}
	else if(balanceDue <= 0)
	{
		summary.add("The Pre-Need is fully paid -- no invoice is created for it. Anything added later is billed as normal.");
	}
	summary.add(releaseMsg);
	if(warnings.size() > 0)
	{
		summary.add("");
		summary.add("Please check:");
		for each  w in warnings
		{
			summary.add("- " + w);
		}
	}
	return summary.toString(nl);
}
catch (eOuter)
{
	return "Get Pre Need Info failed: " + eOuter.toString();
}
return "Done";
}
